      "content": "but i've been reading online that the 99mg ones are basically just a tiny bit more than what's in a banana. if i just took one every other day, it's basically just like eating a piece of fruit, right? it seems like a lot of unnecessary worry for such a small amount. wouldn't that be fine?",
